# Phase 17.4 (audit 8.1): editor/tool backup copies. Three were sitting
# untracked in the working tree -- backend/app/main.py.bak and two
# frontend/app/globals.css.backup-* files. None was committed, but the CSS
# backups live inside Next.js's app/ directory (where the router treats files
# as route candidates) and all three would be swept up by `git add -A` or by
# a `COPY . .` build context that does not exclude them.
*.bak
*.backup-*
*.orig
*.rej
*.save
